&lt;p&gt;As part of Manos Software, a Valsoft operating group, Dispatch combines the focus and agility of a specialized software company with the long-term support of a global vertical SaaS organization. We’re investing in our product, our customers, and our team with a focus on sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a high-impact &lt;strong&gt;SMB Account Executive &lt;/strong&gt;who will focus on selling into Service Providers. The ideal candidate loves hunting for new business, building relationships with owners and operators, and helping service businesses modernize the way they manage and grow their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
